  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 306.08 Compliance Period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 306.08 Compliance Period. No wastewater shall be discharged from any dental practice that is subject to this part unless:\n\n(a) An amalgam separator has been installed and is operating as per Env-Wq 306.04; or\n\n(b) A waiver has been obtained in accordance with Env-Wq 306.07.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 306) #10346, eff 5-22-13 (formerly Env-Wq 306.07)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq300.html"
